{"id":"a2b0a7eb56fecb6a","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md","title":"Gödel Numbering","display":"df-godel-numbering — Gödel Numbering","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-godel-numbering","aliases":["58-df-godel-numbering"],"display":"df-godel-numbering — Gödel Numbering","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-godel-numbering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-godel-numbering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-numbering — Gödel Numbering"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,g\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma,g\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (formula and term sets generated by the same signature; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GodelNumbering}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GodelNumbering}_S\\)</span> (Gödel numbering predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}numbering} \\vdash \\mathrm{GodelNumbering}_S(g,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Function}\\!\\left(g,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\cup\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\omega\\right)\\land \\forall e_1,e_2\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\cup\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\bigl(g(e_1)=g(e_2)\\to e_1=e_2\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}numbering} \\vdash \\mathrm{GodelNumbering}_S(g,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Function}\\!\\left(g,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\cup\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\omega\\right)\\land \\forall e_1,e_2\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\cup\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\bigl(g(e_1)=g(e_2)\\to e_1=e_2\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(e)\">\\(g(e)\\)</span> is the Gödel number of the expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Injectivity ensures that distinct expressions receive distinct codes.</li>\n<li>Primitive-recursive coding and decoding operations are an additional effectiveness condition, not a condition on the range set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a> — 一阶公式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a> — 同一签名上的项与公式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e26933a629751c0c\" href=\"?note=e26933a629751c0c\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md\">../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md</a> — 可证性谓词</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)$ and $\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$ (formula and term sets generated by the same signature; see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}$ (function predicate; see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]] — 一阶公式","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"res